WEBVTT

00:00:18.185 --> 00:00:23.899
Stars glitfer in the breaking dawn sky

00:00:23.899 --> 00:00:28.695
After journeying from light years away

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:34.368
Man predicts our fate and destiny

00:00:34.368 --> 00:00:37.454
But the ulfimafte destination

00:00:37.454 --> 00:00:42.876
Is known only through blood, sweat, and fears

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:46.880
Stargazer! Turn! Turn! Earth!

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:49.800
This life that was born here

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:54.555
Live sfrong and liberare LIGHT

00:00:54.555 --> 00:00:58.559
A strong bond connects our hearts

00:00:58.559 --> 00:01:01.562
You and | who baftle side by side

00:01:01.562 --> 00:01:04.231
The dancing flames of dawn

00:01:04.231 --> 00:01:07.401
The beat that resounds fo efernity

00:01:07.401 --> 00:01:10.070
The harmony of our feelings

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:12.781
Are flaring up... Ah

00:01:12.781 --> 00:01:16.910
Awakening that fingling POWER

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:21.498
Shine on Destination!

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:36.638
Shiryuu Chou'un...

00:01:36.638 --> 00:01:42.477
One move, and Gentoku Ryuubi's head
will be separated from her body.

00:01:43.478 --> 00:01:46.648
If | fight you as you wish,

00:01:46.648 --> 00:01:50.611
do | have your word that
you won't harm our leader?

00:01:50.611 --> 00:01:52.487
Please don't, Shi!

00:01:52.487 --> 00:01:58.619
| did as she asked because | didn't
want to see any more people get hurt.

00:01:59.661 --> 00:02:01.705
Leader...

00:02:01.705 --> 00:02:07.210
You have my word. But if you lose,

00:02:07.210 --> 00:02:10.464
Seito will cease to exist as of today.

00:02:12.674 --> 00:02:18.221
A little to the right... just a little more...
Right there... hold steady!

00:02:18.221 --> 00:02:19.723
Got it!

00:02:19.723 --> 00:02:22.351
Now, more to the leff.

00:02:22.351 --> 00:02:24.645
Shift, shift...

00:02:25.812 --> 00:02:27.564
What kind of fruit is this?

00:02:27.564 --> 00:02:31.068
What's it matter? I'm starving.

00:02:31.068 --> 00:02:33.320
Here goes nothing!

00:02:36.073 --> 00:02:38.200
Sour!

00:02:42.162 --> 00:02:44.039
Delicious...

00:02:44.039 --> 00:02:45.791
No way!

00:02:54.758 --> 00:02:56.426
What is this place?

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:01.223
I'm guessing Nanban High...

00:03:02.933 --> 00:03:04.184
That means...

00:03:04.184 --> 00:03:08.605
We have to sneak in there
and get everybody out...

00:03:08.605 --> 00:03:11.108
- W-What's the matter?
- Shh...

00:03:11.108 --> 00:03:12.442
Look.

00:03:14.695 --> 00:03:16.947
Kan...

00:03:16.947 --> 00:03:20.200
| can't believe they got Chou, too...

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:27.457
Kan, | promise on my pride as a fighter
that | will come to get you...

00:03:29.543 --> 00:03:32.587
Where the hell are they?!

00:03:32.587 --> 00:03:34.464
Of all the bad timing!

00:03:34.464 --> 00:03:38.593
"Shimei Ryomou and
Koukin Shuyu are our hostages."

00:03:38.593 --> 00:03:44.099
"We demand that Nanyo Academy's leader
surrender and pledge her allegiance to Kentei."

00:03:44.099 --> 00:03:48.395
"If she refuses, we cannot guarantee
the life of both hostages.’

00:03:48.395 --> 00:03:53.108
An identical letter was probably
sent to both Kyosho and Seito, as well.

00:03:53.108 --> 00:03:56.445
So the Big Fighters Tournament was all a trap?

00:03:56.445 --> 00:04:00.991
The enemy's objective
was probably fo split us up.

00:04:00.991 --> 00:04:06.246
Yes. It was sheer luck that
Sonsaku didn't come with us.

00:04:09.124 --> 00:04:11.418
Yahoo!

00:04:11.418 --> 00:04:13.336
This feels great!

00:04:17.674 --> 00:04:19.634
Wait for me!

00:04:19.634 --> 00:04:22.262
You're going too fast, Big Sister!

00:04:22.262 --> 00:04:24.973
Faster, Big Sister! Faster!

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:29.811
Are you okay up there?

00:04:32.773 --> 00:04:36.318
Cmon up, Chubo! The view's great!

00:04:36.318 --> 00:04:40.113
| couldn't get up there, Big Sister!

00:04:44.951 --> 00:04:47.496
Did Big Sister catch a summer cold?

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:55.796
Big Sister Hakufu, let's have lunch!

00:04:58.131 --> 00:05:01.051
Big Sister... and Genpo, too0...

00:05:01.051 --> 00:05:04.471
Want to join us, Chubo?
The water's cool and feels great.

00:05:04.471 --> 00:05:09.309
You're both... What if someone should see you?

00:05:09.309 --> 00:05:13.688
No one's watching this far in the mountains.

00:05:13.688 --> 00:05:16.483
So let me guess...
You're embarrassed, aren't you?

00:05:16.483 --> 00:05:20.111
-l pass this fime.

00:05:21.863 --> 00:05:24.825
Ow, it hurts!

00:05:24.825 --> 00:05:26.368
My leg cramped!

00:05:26.368 --> 00:05:28.495
Are you all right, Big Sister?

00:05:29.538 --> 00:05:31.832
Grab onto my hand,

00:05:31.832 --> 00:05:32.999
You let down your guard!

00:05:35.585 --> 00:05:36.878
Gotchal

00:05:39.089 --> 00:05:43.093
That was mean! You tricked me!

00:05:43.093 --> 00:05:46.888
Off! Off it comes!
Last one! Give up already!

00:05:46.888 --> 00:05:48.098
No!

00:05:48.098 --> 00:05:50.684
You see? Now we're all the same.

00:05:50.684 --> 00:05:52.853
Big Sister!

00:05:52.853 --> 00:05:54.688
Good grief...

00:06:03.071 --> 00:06:04.197
Incredible!

00:06:04.197 --> 00:06:07.033
Back you go!

00:06:07.033 --> 00:06:10.370
You can control water at will

00:06:13.748 --> 00:06:15.250
Jeez...

00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:20.297
Koukin and Ryo-chan must be doing
their best in the tournament about now...

00:06:22.883 --> 00:06:27.262
The wound he suffered battling
Ryofu should have healed by now...

00:06:31.057 --> 00:06:33.894
So why is Saji sill...

00:06:36.646 --> 00:06:39.482
Sajil Be strong!

00:06:39.482 --> 00:06:42.402
The doctor says if's not serious.

00:06:42.402 --> 00:06:45.780
But it was quite a surprise fo see you there...

00:06:45.780 --> 00:06:50.076
Maybe | was feverish from
my date with you, Mou-chan...

00:06:50.076 --> 00:06:53.455
D-Don't say such things! | was really worried...

00:06:55.957 --> 00:06:58.251
Thank you, Mou-chan.

00:07:02.839 --> 00:07:08.178
All this happened...
because you told me to go..

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:15.602
Hey! How long are you gonna
keep us cooped up in here?!

00:07:15.602 --> 00:07:20.732
What ever happened to
the tournament? Who's your leader?!

00:07:22.692 --> 00:07:24.611
Fuck you!

00:07:24.611 --> 00:07:26.529
Have you got some phobia
about talking fo people?!

00:07:26.529 --> 00:07:28.615
- Do you realize who | am?
- Save your breath.

00:07:28.615 --> 00:07:30.951
Nothing you say will do any good.

00:07:30.951 --> 00:07:32.535
Why not?

00:07:32.535 --> 00:07:37.791
Nanban High is made up of
rejects from all the other schools.

00:07:37.791 --> 00:07:42.504
But | heard you guys
had an alliance with them...

00:07:42.504 --> 00:07:47.133
Once. But then we couldn't
even falk with those guys.

00:07:47.133 --> 00:07:49.010
What do you mean?

00:07:49.010 --> 00:07:54.349
Before hegemony ever came up, they had
huge issues trying to decide their leader.

00:07:54.349 --> 00:07:58.895
Right now, their leaders are
two sisters, Moukaku and Mouyuu.

00:07:58.895 --> 00:08:04.359
They have no trust in or
willingness to help their friends.

00:08:04.359 --> 00:08:09.197
So it's a wonder they got
together to entrap us all.

00:08:09.197 --> 00:08:13.868
What you're saying is...
Kentei is pulling the strings?

00:08:13.868 --> 00:08:19.708
Probably. But we have no idea who Kentei is.

00:08:24.337 --> 00:08:27.215
Hey! Be nicer to the wounded!

00:08:27.215 --> 00:08:29.300
Chounhi, are you all right?

00:08:31.011 --> 00:08:32.429
What is this place?

00:08:32.429 --> 00:08:36.182
Nanban High. We were all captured.

00:08:36.182 --> 00:08:38.560
Wasn't Kan'v with you?

00:08:38.560 --> 00:08:41.062
Did you get separated in the ocean?

00:08:41.062 --> 00:08:45.734
Kan... | remember now... she can't see...

00:08:45.734 --> 00:08:48.695
| was with her, but | couldn't help her... Dammit!

00:08:50.864 --> 00:08:54.242
Who's the bastard who
sent such a bullshit thing?!

00:08:54.242 --> 00:08:56.369
Please calm down, Kakoton.

00:08:56.369 --> 00:09:00.749
Kentei isn't the only one
seeking hegemony over Kanto.

00:09:02.625 --> 00:09:05.712
Now that you mention it, you're right.

00:09:05.712 --> 00:09:09.591
We still aren't sure who killed Kaku, either.

00:09:09.591 --> 00:09:16.598
I'd be disrespecting him if | lost
sight of the true reason why we fight.

00:09:16.598 --> 00:09:19.809
| agree with that opinion.

00:09:19.809 --> 00:09:21.561
Moutoku...

00:09:21.561 --> 00:09:25.065
Ton, walk with me.

00:09:25.065 --> 00:09:27.609
There's someplace | want to go.

00:09:29.486 --> 00:09:34.074
Back in the day, you, me, and
Kakuka came here often, didn't we?

00:09:34.074 --> 00:09:39.454
Yeah, but that fool went and
died before the rest of us...

00:09:41.289 --> 00:09:44.084
What're you doing, Moutoku?

00:09:44.084 --> 00:09:45.251
Ton...

00:09:47.962 --> 00:09:50.423
Kakuka is sfill alive.

00:09:55.637 --> 00:10:00.600
Yo! You always did have bad taste in clothes.

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:04.145
You... didn't die?

00:10:04.145 --> 00:10:05.688
Who knows?

00:10:12.445 --> 00:10:16.825
More importantly, there's a crazy bastard loose.

00:10:16.825 --> 00:10:18.284
What?!

00:10:21.371 --> 00:10:24.624
What the hell are you talking about?

00:10:24.624 --> 00:10:28.378
Was it Kyocho and Soujin
who went to the tournament?

00:10:28.378 --> 00:10:31.464
T-That's right. We have
to hurry and rescue them.

00:10:31.464 --> 00:10:34.801
Someone will... but it won't be me.

00:10:36.177 --> 00:10:38.888
It'll be those people beyond there.

00:10:42.517 --> 00:10:44.144
Wow!

00:10:44.144 --> 00:10:46.980
It's been a while since ['ve
had a box lunch from Chubo!

00:10:46.980 --> 00:10:49.732
Please help yourself fo lots.

00:10:49.732 --> 00:10:53.653
Don't mind if | do! Thank you!

00:10:57.699 --> 00:10:59.784
Delicious!

00:11:04.873 --> 00:11:07.000
Is something the matter?

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:08.334
Someone's watching us...

00:11:08.334 --> 00:11:10.920
Huh?! From where?

00:11:10.920 --> 00:11:12.338
Nof here.

00:11:13.423 --> 00:11:17.010
Way, way over there...

00:11:42.452 --> 00:11:46.956
You seem to miss fighting, Hakufu Sonsaku.

00:11:46.956 --> 00:11:49.250
Is that Sousou of Kyosho?

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:51.920
What's going on?

00:11:51.920 --> 00:11:56.382
At the Battle of Red Cliffs,

00:11:56.382 --> 00:12:01.137
you saved my life with the
power of your life force...

00:12:06.392 --> 00:12:10.396
The power of my life force?

00:12:10.396 --> 00:12:13.233
| don't quite understand what
you're talking about, but...

00:12:13.233 --> 00:12:17.904
What is it that we fighters fight for?

00:12:17.904 --> 00:12:21.574
| do it because fighting strong
opponents gives me a thrill.

00:12:21.574 --> 00:12:25.745
And because fighting strong
opponents makes me stronger.

00:12:25.745 --> 00:12:27.914
Are those the only reasons?

00:12:27.914 --> 00:12:29.624
You're the leader, aren't you?

00:12:29.624 --> 00:12:31.084
l... am.

00:12:31.084 --> 00:12:33.628
Why do you want to become stronger?

00:12:33.628 --> 00:12:35.964
Umm...

00:12:35.964 --> 00:12:41.552
| want to become stronger because...
| wanted to protect people...

00:12:44.597 --> 00:12:47.058
..by becoming strong.

00:12:52.105 --> 00:12:52.939
I-u

00:12:52.939 --> 00:12:55.108
- There is an enemy.
- Huh?

00:12:55.108 --> 00:12:59.821
An enemy who despises fighters
like us and wants to destroy us all...

00:12:59.821 --> 00:13:00.863
An enemy?

00:13:00.863 --> 00:13:06.786
Fulfill your mission as
a fighter... and as a leader.

00:13:06.786 --> 00:13:10.331
Do it for the sake of those
who will frust and follow you...

00:13:10.331 --> 00:13:13.126
That is your strength.

00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:19.132
I'm really sorry, Chubo.

00:13:19.132 --> 00:13:21.718
'l leisurely enjoy your
box lunch some other time.

00:13:21.718 --> 00:13:26.848
- Ill count that as a promise, Big Sister.
- Take care, Big Sister Hakufu.

00:13:26.848 --> 00:13:30.143
Il see you two again later!

00:13:30.143 --> 00:13:32.061
Goodbye!

00:13:33.980 --> 00:13:36.566
Everyone is waiting for Big Sister.

00:13:36.566 --> 00:13:37.650
Huh?

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:41.112
A battle is summoning Big Sister...

00:13:43.323 --> 00:13:45.033
Big Sister...

00:13:58.421 --> 00:14:02.759
Welcome to my castle, Uncho Kan'v.

00:14:02.759 --> 00:14:03.718
Who are you?!

00:14:03.718 --> 00:14:08.931
My name is Kentei.
Supreme ruler and emperor.

00:14:08.931 --> 00:14:11.934
So you're the one who fancies himself Kentei?

00:14:11.934 --> 00:14:13.686
Watch your tongue.

00:14:13.686 --> 00:14:16.731
Do not forget that your
friends are my hostages.

00:14:18.232 --> 00:14:23.780
For what purpose have you besmirched
the good name of our sacred tournament?

00:14:23.780 --> 00:14:29.077
If you wish for hegemony,
fight us directly, fair and square!

00:14:29.077 --> 00:14:30.912
Fight, you say?

00:14:30.912 --> 00:14:34.123
That is all you fools have to live for.

00:14:34.123 --> 00:14:37.877
Your destiny is one of mutual killing and ruin.

00:14:39.462 --> 00:14:41.297
You're
wrong!

00:14:41.297 --> 00:14:46.636
We fighters polish our skills
as we dream of hegemony.

00:14:46.636 --> 00:14:50.765
We share that dream and
fight for that bond between us!

00:14:50.765 --> 00:14:56.979
Nonsense. Only the chosen shall write history.

00:14:59.107 --> 00:15:07.281
No amount of you lowly foot soldiers
will amount to anything more than mice!

00:15:08.282 --> 00:15:12.662
Fine. Then find out how
strong this mouse can be.

00:15:12.662 --> 00:15:15.498
Fight me one-on-one.

00:15:16.791 --> 00:15:19.085
Do not worry.

00:15:19.085 --> 00:15:23.256
The Big Fighters Tournament will be held, but...

00:15:27.969 --> 00:15:30.096
According to my rules.

00:15:36.686 --> 00:15:38.604
This tingling in my eyes...

00:15:40.189 --> 00:15:44.318
Kan... 'm coming now...

00:15:44.318 --> 00:15:46.028
You mustn't. Not in your condition.

00:15:46.028 --> 00:15:49.198
Doing something reckless
will make your injuries worse.

00:15:49.198 --> 00:15:54.328
Never mind me... If | don't go fo Kan, shelll..

00:15:54.328 --> 00:15:58.207
Quit your bawling, stupid!

00:15:58.207 --> 00:15:59.959
Moukaku!

00:15:59.959 --> 00:16:04.338
| came to have a look to kill fime...
you guys look pretty spunky.

00:16:04.338 --> 00:16:07.842
So that's Nanban High's leader...

00:16:07.842 --> 00:16:10.219
Damn you! What've you done with Kan?

00:16:10.219 --> 00:16:15.141
Oh yeah, you were passed
out so you don't know.

00:16:15.141 --> 00:16:17.059
What?

00:16:17.059 --> 00:16:21.189
She gave herself up o save your life.

00:16:21.189 --> 00:16:24.567
She's probably with Kentei right now.

00:16:24.567 --> 00:16:28.196
Who is Kentei? Why is he together with you?

00:16:28.196 --> 00:16:30.573
Who is he, you ask?

00:16:30.573 --> 00:16:32.700
How would | know?

00:16:32.700 --> 00:16:37.538
Our objectives just jibed, that's all.

00:16:37.538 --> 00:16:42.752
We both want to kill all you Kanto fighters!

00:16:42.752 --> 00:16:49.383
Kan'u is here... That extreme fighting
spirit I've been sensing is hers...

00:16:49.383 --> 00:16:54.388
Kan... you did that... for me?

00:16:54.388 --> 00:16:57.683
I'm a fool. A damn fool!

00:17:18.746 --> 00:17:22.083
| got struck because | couldn't
judge the distance in the air...

00:17:38.933 --> 00:17:41.227
That's more like Uncho Kan'u.

00:17:41.227 --> 00:17:45.231
But the stronger you are, the better it is for me.

00:17:49.277 --> 00:17:55.241
Your strength will bring out
the evil inside of you.

00:17:55.241 --> 00:17:57.243
W-Why?

00:17:57.243 --> 00:18:00.621
That blow should've shattered its skull...

00:18:22.602 --> 00:18:25.605
Until | bring Ekitoku back with me to Seito...

00:18:25.605 --> 00:18:29.775
| can't get killed in a place like this...

00:18:40.494 --> 00:18:42.038
Gentoku!

00:19:06.729 --> 00:19:09.148
Want to keep going?

00:19:12.693 --> 00:19:17.323
Shi... The match is over.

00:19:17.323 --> 00:19:20.868
Please let that person go.

00:19:24.664 --> 00:19:27.917
| admit defeat.

00:19:27.917 --> 00:19:29.335
However...

00:19:32.588 --> 00:19:37.259
| will atone for the disgrace
of defeat by taking my own life.

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:51.524
Why do we fight?

00:19:53.067 --> 00:19:56.696
Why must we hurt each
other and spill our blood...

00:19:56.696 --> 00:19:59.532
Leader... that power...

00:19:59.532 --> 00:20:02.868
We fight for our schools and for sacred beads...

00:20:02.868 --> 00:20:06.372
But there are always casualties...

00:20:06.372 --> 00:20:09.250
It might be our destiny...

00:20:09.250 --> 00:20:15.881
But | don't want to be a fighter to
the point where | lose my human soul...

00:20:15.881 --> 00:20:24.056
| believe life is the most... important... thing...

00:20:29.270 --> 00:20:31.731
What're you going to do with me?

00:20:31.731 --> 00:20:34.734
First, we'll treat your wounds.

00:20:34.734 --> 00:20:39.405
That is the will of our virtuous
leader, Gentoku Ryuubi.

00:20:44.994 --> 00:20:48.581
Sparing my life won't change a thing...

00:20:48.581 --> 00:20:54.795
As long as he continues to seek Seita's
leader’s life, he'll come with his next plan.

00:20:54.795 --> 00:20:56.756
You're referring to Kentei?

00:20:58.132 --> 00:21:02.344
| want you to tell us what
you know about Kentei.

00:21:02.344 --> 00:21:05.306
Please... for Gentoku's sake.

00:21:07.975 --> 00:21:13.189
When | saw his face under that mask...

00:21:13.189 --> 00:21:14.356
It can't bel

00:21:14.356 --> 00:21:15.775
What's wrong?

00:21:24.658 --> 00:21:26.702
It seems this...

00:21:29.121 --> 00:21:33.083
..might be his next plan...

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:40.007
Chapter 6 "Swarming Fangs"
The End

00:21:45.888 --> 00:21:48.516
Within the sform that rages now

00:21:48.516 --> 00:21:52.144
| fake hold of this destiny

00:21:52.144 --> 00:21:54.980
Even if Im hurt or die My heart

00:21:54.980 --> 00:21:57.983
! won't surrender, noft for a second

00:21:57.983 --> 00:22:05.908
0h, love which reaches fowards fhe heavens

00:22:05.908 --> 00:22:09.411
Break through the darkness

00:22:09.411 --> 00:22:12.331
If we don't waver and face our foes

00:22:12.331 --> 00:22:15.167
There will be a cloudless future

00:22:15.167 --> 00:22:18.087
/ have faith it's waiting for us We belleve

00:22:18.087 --> 00:22:21.090
So let's fight fogether now

00:22:21.090 --> 00:22:29.181
Feelings and emotions borne from our red blood

00:22:29.181 --> 00:22:32.768
Irreplaceable beings

00:22:37.606 --> 00:22:44.697
We all live fo profect those we love

00:22:49.118 --> 00:22:54.915
We are all endless fighters

00:22:54.915 --> 00:23:04.925
Our souls share a bond

00:23:04.925 --> 00:23:09.889
